<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Prompt xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <masterLabel>Reports Relative Date Value Filter Criteria</masterLabel>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;Relative date values are available for reporting/list views. A date filter could be used, for example, to display data on a report only for the past 90 days, or 6 days, or perhaps only data for the current quarter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To create a filter with Relative Dates for a report,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Access the report to add the filter to. Click &lt;strong&gt;Edit&lt;/strong&gt; to edit the report.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;From the &lt;strong&gt;Filter&lt;/strong&gt; panel, use the &lt;strong&gt;Add Filter&lt;/strong&gt; field to locate and select the &lt;strong&gt;Created Date&lt;/strong&gt; filter.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In the &lt;strong&gt;Filter by Created Date&lt;/strong&gt; filter, click the &lt;strong&gt;Use relative date&lt;/strong&gt; link.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The date field changes to Relative Date and examples are provided. Type in your relative date. Note that relative date values are not case-sensitive and multiple range values can be used in a single field, separated by commas. See examples below.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Click &lt;strong&gt;Apply&lt;/strong&gt; once finished.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relative Date Examples&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Some examples of relative dates that can be used are: YESTERDAY, TODAY, TOMORROW, LAST WEEK, THIS WEEK, LAST n WEEKS, n WEEKS AGO, LAST MONTH, LAST QUARTER, THIS QUARTER, LAST n QUARTERS, LAST FISCAL YEAR, n FISCAL YEARS AGO, etc. For a complete list, with definitions, refer to the &lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/training-and-help/reporting/filter-criteria-relative-date-value/#LEXdaterangedef&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Filter Criteria&lt;/a&gt; training page.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goto.intel.com/in-app-feedback&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feedback and additional training topic suggestions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; are always welcome and reviewed quarterly.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</body>
        <customApplication>standard__LightningSales</customApplication>
        <delayDays>1</delayDays>
        <description>Reports Relative Date Value Filter Criteria</description>
        <displayType>DockedComposer</displayType>
        <header>Reports</header>
        <isPublished>true</isPublished>
        <masterLabel>Reports Relative Date Value Filter Criteria</masterLabel>
        <publishedDate>2024-02-02</publishedDate>
        <shouldDisplayActionButton>false</shouldDisplayActionButton>
        <shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>false</shouldIgnoreGlobalDelay>
        <startDate>2023-05-10</startDate>
        <targetPageKey1>Report</targetPageKey1>
        <targetPageKey2>home</targetPageKey2>
        <targetPageType>standard__objectPage</targetPageType>
        <themeColor>Theme2</themeColor>
        <themeSaturation>Dark</themeSaturation>
        <timesToDisplay>1</timesToDisplay>
        <title>Relative Date Value: Filter Criteria</title>
        <userAccess>Everyone</userAccess>
        <userProfileAccess>Everyone</userProfileAccess>
        <versionNumber>1</versionNumber>
    </promptVersions>
</Prompt>
